<title>ITALY: ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS MEDALS TABLE.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS MEDALS TABLE.</headline>
<dateline>SESTRIERE, Italy 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medals table after the</p>
<p>women's downhill and combined event at the Alpine skiing world</p>
<p>championships on Saturday:</p>
<p>		    Gold     Silver     Bronze</p>
<p> Italy	     3	   1	     1</p>
<p> Norway	    2	   3	     -</p>
<p> Switzerland     2	   3	     1</p>
<p> Austria	   1	   -	     3</p>
<p> United States   1	   -	     -</p>
<p> Germany	   -	   2	     2</p>
<p> France	    -	   -	     1</p>
<p> Sweden	    -	   -	     1</p>
</text>
